   63----   10.00   ZTIP   Pile tip Z-level for axial capacity calculations               
   64----   1    MATPIL Pile wall material type: 1=steel 2=concrete                       
   65---- *  Calculation methods : 0=Given values  1=API-93  2=ICP-05  3=NGI-05           
